INT. HOTEL BATHHOUSE - DUST CREEK - NOON

Steam. A copper tub. A rag rug.

MERCY TATE (30s, gunbelt on a hook, hair pinned up) soaks to her chin. SADIE QUINN (20s, hotel maid, towels on her arm) sits on the lid of a barrel. JEB HOLLOWAY (50s, bounty man, spurs, dust in his beard) fills the doorway, one hand on the butt of his revolver.

JEB
Mercy Tate.

MERCY
Jeb.

SADIE
Mister, this is a lady's bath.

JEB
I see that.

Mercy leans back. The water slops. Sadie slides off the barrel and slips between them. Jeb steps in. Mercy reaches for the gunbelt on its hook, but Sadie gets there first, takes it, and holds it behind her back. Jeb draws. Sadie pales. Mercy rises half out of the water, steam pouring off her shoulders, and lifts a hand to stop everyone.

MERCY
Easy, all of you.

JEB
I've got paper on you.

SADIE
She's got a bath on her.

Jeb lowers the gun an inch. Mercy sinks back into the water.

MERCY
Sit down, Jeb. You're letting out the heat.
